{"id":"30b341bfbd8b5301","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-congruence.md","title":"Congruence","display":"df-congruence — Congruence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-congruence","aliases":["93-df-congruence"],"display":"df-congruence — Congruence","depends_on":["[[93-df-algebra]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-congruence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-congruence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-congruence — Congruence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\)</span> is an algebra candidate and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\">\\(\\theta\\)</span> is a relation candidate.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\\)</span> is the algebra predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathfrak A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathfrak A)\\)</span> is the congruence set defined by membership below.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}\">\\(\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}\">\\(\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}\\)</span> 的定义域为满足某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\)</span> 的代数。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}congruence}\\vdash\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathfrak A)\\leftrightarrow\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\Bigl[{}&amp;\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle}(\\mathfrak A)\\land\\theta\\subseteq|\\mathfrak A|^2\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a\\in|\\mathfrak A|\\;(\\langle a,a\\rangle\\in\\theta)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b\\in|\\mathfrak A|\\;(\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in\\theta\\to\\langle b,a\\rangle\\in\\theta)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in|\\mathfrak A|\\;(\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in\\theta\\land\\langle b,c\\rangle\\in\\theta\\to\\langle a,c\\rangle\\in\\theta)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f\\in S\\;\\forall\\bar a,\\bar b\\in|\\mathfrak A|^{\\alpha(f)}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\forall i&lt;\\alpha(f)\\;(\\langle\\bar a(i),\\bar b(i)\\rangle\\in\\theta)\n\\to\\langle f^{\\mathfrak A}(\\bar a),f^{\\mathfrak A}(\\bar b)\\rangle\\in\\theta\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}congruence}\\vdash\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathfrak A)\\leftrightarrow\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\Bigl[{}&amp;\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle}(\\mathfrak A)\\land\\theta\\subseteq|\\mathfrak A|^2\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a\\in|\\mathfrak A|\\;(\\langle a,a\\rangle\\in\\theta)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b\\in|\\mathfrak A|\\;(\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in\\theta\\to\\langle b,a\\rangle\\in\\theta)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in|\\mathfrak A|\\;(\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in\\theta\\land\\langle b,c\\rangle\\in\\theta\\to\\langle a,c\\rangle\\in\\theta)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f\\in S\\;\\forall\\bar a,\\bar b\\in|\\mathfrak A|^{\\alpha(f)}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\forall i&lt;\\alpha(f)\\;(\\langle\\bar a(i),\\bar b(i)\\rangle\\in\\theta)\n\\to\\langle f^{\\mathfrak A}(\\bar a),f^{\\mathfrak A}(\\bar b)\\rangle\\in\\theta\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle a,a\\rangle:a\\in|\\mathbf A|\\},\\qquad\n\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}\\coloneqq|\\mathbf A|\\times|\\mathbf A|\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle a,a\\rangle:a\\in|\\mathbf A|\\},\\qquad\n\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}\\coloneqq|\\mathbf A|\\times|\\mathbf A|\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\to\n\\bigl(\\Delta_{\\mathbf A},\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\n\\land\\forall\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\;\n(\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}\\subseteq\\theta\\subseteq\\nabla_{\\mathbf A})\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\to\n\\bigl(\\Delta_{\\mathbf A},\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\n\\land\\forall\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\;\n(\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}\\subseteq\\theta\\subseteq\\nabla_{\\mathbf A})\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Equivalence and compatibility are expanded over the actual carrier, and the quantified pair <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\">\\(\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\\)</span> is recovered from the algebra rather than left as contextual data.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}$ is the algebra predicate of [[93-df-algebra]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak A","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathfrak A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}congruence}\\vdash\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathfrak A)\\leftrightarrow\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\Bigl[{}&\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle}(\\mathfrak A)\\land\\theta\\subseteq|\\mathfrak A|^2\\\\\n&\\land\\forall a\\in|\\mathfrak A|\\;(\\langle a,a\\rangle\\in\\theta)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall a,b\\in|\\mathfrak A|\\;(\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in\\theta\\to\\langle b,a\\rangle\\in\\theta)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in|\\mathfrak A|\\;(\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in\\theta\\land\\langle b,c\\rangle\\in\\theta\\to\\langle a,c\\rangle\\in\\theta)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall f\\in S\\;\\forall\\bar a,\\bar b\\in|\\mathfrak A|^{\\alpha(f)}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\forall i<\\alpha(f)\\;(\\langle\\bar a(i),\\bar b(i)\\rangle\\in\\theta)\n\\to\\langle f^{\\mathfrak A}(\\bar a),f^{\\mathfrak A}(\\bar b)\\rangle\\in\\theta\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle a,a\\rangle:a\\in|\\mathbf A|\\},\\qquad\n\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}\\coloneqq|\\mathbf A|\\times|\\mathbf A|","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\to\n\\bigl(\\Delta_{\\mathbf A},\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\n\\land\\forall\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\;\n(\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}\\subseteq\\theta\\subseteq\\nabla_{\\mathbf A})\\bigr)","display":true},{"t